    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You had a goal in mind—knowledge, power, or perhaps hidden secrets. One way or another, your path led you to seek out a being from beyond your plane. Once you made contact, a deal was struck, and your life was never the same.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> A Planar Pact feat of your choice</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and Persuasion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCalligraph]{Calligrapher's Supplies}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBook0000000]{Book}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCalligraph]{Calligrapher's Supplies}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInk00000000]{Ink}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInkPen00000]{Ink Pen}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagParchment00]{Parchment} (10 sheets), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 2 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
